              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eki n'ekigambo eki nabi Yeremia yaagmbiire Baruki mwene Neria, obu yaahandiika ebigambo ebi omu kitabo, naabigambirwa Yeremia omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu mwene Yosia omugabe wa Yuda, naagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
