              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu nooyesherurira ebikuru? Otabisherura. Ahabw'okuba reeba, naaza kureeta akabi aha bantu boona; kwonak iwe ndyakutimbuura omu rugamba n'engabirano, nigo magara gaawe, omu myanya yoona ei orizamu; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.",
